<title>USA: Primadonna board OKs increased repurchase.</title>
<headline>Primadonna board OKs increased repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>PRIMM, Nev. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primadonna Resorts Inc said its board of directors approved an increase in its stock repurchase program.  This action represents an increase from $15 million to $50 million.</p>
<p>Repurchases will be made from time to time in open market and/or privately negotiated transactions based on then current market prices.  At October 31, 1996 Primadonna had 30,024,475 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
